Subject: [PATCH] AppOps: keep stock client with explicit optional host services

Health Connect and device privacy usage require Android modules and device
controllers that are not started here. Keep permission/operation mappings,
Binder calls, parcels, callbacks and mode handling in stock AppOpsManager.
Use the ZygoteInit class name directly when trimming diagnostic stack traces;
this does not require loading Android zygote code.

